# Shopify data is off-limits

- **Never delete, cancel, archive, or mutate live Shopify data** (products, orders, customers, companies, inventory, discounts, metafields, or anything else on `c906ff-0a.myshopify.com` / uniquedistribution.com).
- Shopify forensic-audit scripts are **read-only**. Do not send Admin GraphQL mutations against the live store.
- If a prompt could mean Shopify **or** Supabase (or is otherwise ambiguous about *which* system to wipe), **stop and ask three separate confirmation questions** before taking any destructive action. Do not proceed on a single yes.

Supabase demo/commerce data in project `The UD Revamp` (`oelolusdbaoyiqkgukib`) is a different system and may be wiped only when the user clearly names Supabase.
